@startuml
title Customer Service - Register, Login, Profile
actor CustomerUser as User
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "CustomerViewSet" as CustomerAPI
database "Customer DB" as DB
participant "TokenAuth" as TokenAuth

== Register ==
User -> Gateway: POST /api/customers/register
Gateway -> CustomerAPI: register(data)
CustomerAPI -> DB: Create User + Customer
DB --> CustomerAPI: created
CustomerAPI --> Gateway: 201 registered
Gateway --> User: 201 registered

== Login ==
User -> Gateway: POST /api/customers/login
Gateway -> CustomerAPI: login(username, password)
CustomerAPI -> TokenAuth: authenticate()
TokenAuth --> CustomerAPI: user
CustomerAPI -> DB: get_or_create Token, load Customer
DB --> CustomerAPI: token + customer
CustomerAPI --> Gateway: token, customer
Gateway --> User: token, customer

== Profile ==
User -> Gateway: GET /api/customers/profile
Gateway -> CustomerAPI: profile(Token)
CustomerAPI -> TokenAuth: validate token
TokenAuth --> CustomerAPI: request.user
CustomerAPI -> DB: Load Customer by user
DB --> CustomerAPI: profile data
CustomerAPI --> Gateway: profile data
Gateway --> User: profile data
@enduml

